# corpus/collection-copies
profile own
scope.begin arrays
new a A
new b B
new c C
array original a b c
bind original_bind original
scope.begin copied
slice sliced original 0 2
use sliced
scope.end copied
check ''
array retained a c
use retained
check ''
scope.end arrays
check CBA
reset.log
scope.begin maps
new ma A
new mb B
object map z=ma a=mb
bind map_bind map
scope.begin derived
array values mb ma
object fewer a=mb
use values
use fewer
scope.end derived
check ''
scope.end maps
check BA
